    "detailed_description": "It\u2019s Halloween night. You had nothing planned, but your friends dragged you out.<br><br>Explore the neighborhood and meet its curious inhabitants. Find out what\u2019s going on with the new fast-food restaurant in town that seems to draw everyone\u2019s attention, and solve puzzles by using bizarre mobile apps.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself in the story and mysteries surrounding your neighborhood<br></li><li> Gather weird mobile apps and use them to solve puzzles and other missions<br></li><li> Follow the main story, or explore the surroundings to find new missions and secrets <br></li><li> Explore the neighborhood and all its nooks and crannies: the fast-food restaurant, the grocery store, the &quot;haunted&quot; house...<br></li><li> Achieve your collector dreams: get all of the 9 mobiles apps ; find all secret phone numbers &amp; photos ; unlock all modes on the different apps</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "It\u2019s Halloween night. You had nothing planned, but your friends dragged you out.<br><br>Explore the neighborhood and meet its curious inhabitants. Find out what\u2019s going on with the new fast-food restaurant in town that seems to draw everyone\u2019s attention, and solve puzzles by using bizarre mobile apps.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself in the story and mysteries surrounding your neighborhood<br></li><li> Gather weird mobile apps and use them to solve puzzles and other missions<br></li><li> Follow the main story, or explore the surroundings to find new missions and secrets <br></li><li> Explore the neighborhood and all its nooks and crannies: the fast-food restaurant, the grocery store, the &quot;haunted&quot; house...<br></li><li> Achieve your collector dreams: get all of the 9 mobiles apps ; find all secret phone numbers &amp; photos ; unlock all modes on the different apps</li></ul>",
